# desktop.packages - Tier 3: the full Hyprland session (nested or VNC).
#
# Under WSL2 Hyprland CANNOT drive a real display: WSLg exposes /dev/dxg for
# rendering but no /dev/dri/cardN with kernel mode-setting, so wlroots' DRM
# backend aborts with `wlr_backend_get_drm_fd() failed!`.
#
# We therefore run Hyprland with its *Wayland* backend (nested inside WSLg) or
# its *headless* backend behind wayvnc. See docs/03-modes.md.
#
# Enable with: make build PROFILE=desktop

# --- compositor ---
hyprland
hyprland-protocols
xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland

# --- Hyprland companions that work without KMS/hardware ---
hyprpicker
hyprlang
hyprutils

# --- bar, launcher, notifications, wallpaper ---
waybar
wofi
mako
swaybg

# --- Omarchy's Quickshell-based desktop kit ---
quickshell

# --- screenshot / input synthesis ---
grim
slurp
wtype

# --- XWayland so X11-only apps work inside the nested session ---
xorg-xwayland

# --- seat management (wlroots links against libseat) ---
seatd

# --- remote access for the "desktop in a window" mode ---
wayvnc

# --- polkit agent so GUI privilege prompts resolve ---
polkit-gnome

# --- audio (WSLg provides a PulseAudio server; pipewire clients still help) ---
pipewire
pipewire-pulse
wireplumber
pamixer
